  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_WILD_MULTIPLIER
    value: <style=title><size=42>WILD MULTIPLIER
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_WILD_MULTIPLIER
    value: "<size=18>        \n are Wild Multipliers and                                                  \n
      \         Substitute for.\n\n\nAwards for winning outcomes with one Wild Multiplier
      symbol and \ntwo matching non- wild symbols, multiplied by the multiplier value.\n\nAwards
      for winning outcomes with two Wild Multiplier symbols and\none matching non-wild
      symbol, multiplied by both multiplier values.\n\nOutcomes with one or two Wild
      multiplier symbols that do not \nform a three-symbol winner are paid the corresponding
      \n\u201Cany Wild Multiplier\u201D award listed in the pay table.\n\n\n\nappear
      only on reel 2\n"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_SPIN
    value: <style=title><size=42>SPIN OF FORTUNE WHEEL
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_DOUBLE_DICE
    value: "<size=26>Three                     on any pay line triggers Mega Wheel
      bonus. \n-  The values shown on the wheel wedges are multipliers.\n    When
      the wheel stops spinning, the Winning multiplier is indicated    \n    by the
      pointer. This value is multiplied by the line bet to determine \n    the win
      amount."
